# fansboda-finance

Lightweight weekly pipeline: yfinance → SMA-50/200 + close → Neon Postgres. Runs on a GCP `e2-micro` VM via cron (Thursdays 11:00 UTC). ~$0/month target.

**Source of truth:** `project-docs/PRD.md` — read it when changing behavior, schema, or infra. Also see `project-docs/FEATURES.md` (feature map), `project-docs/MIGRATIONS.md` (DDL upgrades), and `project-docs/rfc/` for design detail.

## Scope (do not add without explicit request)

- No UI, API, auth layer, portfolio tracking, or extra indicators (EMA, RSI, MACD).
- No intraday/real-time data; weekly Thursday job only.
- `backfill_sma.py` is a **one-off manual** bootstrap — never cron-schedule it on production.
- Planned but not built: metadata refresh (`RFC-010`), dashboard, gap detection — see PRD §11.

